      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `extract_text.py` for extracting plain text from a scanned document image, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. Amazon Textract is a suitable service for this task, as it can extract text from documents. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with Amazon Textract. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Amazon Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889403910,
          "start": 1789889401667
        },
